:: Deadwood Robin Romance Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-robin-independent-note-link'>>
  <<if $RobinExpansion.selfRent and $RobinExpansion.asylum.status isnot 'admitted' and $robinmissing is 0 and $robinnote isnot 1 and $robinromance isnot 1 and C.npc.Robin.lust gte 10 and C.npc.Robin.love gte 60 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 10>>
    <span class='gold'><<lanSwitch 'There is a note by the window in Robin’s handwriting.' '窗边有张纸条，是罗宾的笔迹。'>></span><br>
    <<mysteryicon>><<lanLink ['Read the note Robin left', '读罗宾留下的纸条'] 'Deadwood Robin Independent Note'>><<set $robinnote to 1>><</lanLink>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Robin Independent Note []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<lanSwitch 'You unfold Robin’s note. Some lines have been crossed out and written again.' '你展开罗宾的纸条。有几句话被划掉，又重新写了一遍。'>>
<br><br><i>
<<lanSwitch 'I have wanted to tell you this for a long time, but whenever you come near me the words will not come out. I have learned to keep my own accounts now, and to make my own decisions. I did not learn that on my own, but it is mine now. I am glad you are still here to see it.' '这件事我想告诉你很久了，可每次你靠近，我就说不出口。我现在会自己记账，也会自己作决定了。这些不是我一个人学会的，可从今往后它们是属于我的。很高兴你还在，能看见这些。'>>
<br><br>
<<lanSwitch 'When you come by the stall, I start looking for you before I even hear your steps. When you hold me, I feel like I am melting, and I mean that in a good way. I care about you, and I do not know how to say it any better than that.' '你来摊位时，我还没听见脚步声，就已经在找你了。你抱住我的时候，我觉得自己快要融化掉了——我是指好的方面。我喜欢你，可我不知道还能怎么说才好。'>>
<br><br>
<<lanSwitch 'Would you be my <span class="gold">partner</span>?' '你愿意做我的<span class="gold"><<girlfriend>></span>吗？'>><br>
<<if isCrossdressing() or $backgroundTraits.includes('crossdresser')>>
  <<lanSwitch 'If another word feels better, tell me. I want to call you what you choose.' '如果你更喜欢别的称呼，请告诉我。我想用你自己喜欢的那个。'>><br>
<</if>>
<<lanSwitch 'If you would rather not, that is all right. Please just pretend you never read this, or I will die of embarrassment.' '你要是不愿意也没关系。就当作从没读过这封信吧，不然我会尴尬死的 T_T'>>
<br><br><<lanSwitch 'Robin' '罗宾'>>
</i>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Put the note away', '收好纸条'] 'Bedroom'>><</lanLink>>
